        },
        {
          "id": "t2",
          "parentId": "t1",
          "role": "assistant",
          "text": "Found it. The retry timer started before the first request settled, so a slow first attempt and its retry could both succeed and the test saw two uploads.\n\n- The retry now waits for the first attempt to fail before it schedules.\n- I added a test that holds the first request open and checks only one upload lands.\n\nThe suite passes 50 runs in a row.",
          "createdAt": "2026-11-10T09:21:00.000Z",
